  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758870,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Year Crest (Commodore 64) - Synopsis\n\n1 Year Crest plunges you into the tumultuous skies above the Pacific during World War II, a relentless vertical-scrolling shooter for the Commodore 64. Taking direct inspiration from classics like 1942, you pilot a Lockheed P-38 Lightning fighter, battling swarms of Japanese aircraft across a beautifully rendered, island-strewn landscape. \n\nExperience intense dogfights as you weave and dodge enemy fire, utilizing a limited number of defensive loop maneuvers to stay alive. Collect power-ups to enhance your firepower and overcome increasingly challenging enemy formations. A strategic map displayed on-screen provides a vital overview of your progress and the unfolding conflict. \n\nThe game’s difficulty is unforgiving; you begin with only three lives, demanding precision and skill to survive. 1 Year Crest delivers a thrilling, nostalgic arcade experience, capturing the frantic pace and visual charm of the golden age of shoot 'em ups, all while offering a fresh and engaging challenge for Commodore 64 enthusiasts."
    },
